# Production web traffic is published by the remotely managed Cloudflare Tunnel.
#
#   hllfrontline.com               -> http://127.0.0.1:7020
#   7drhistostats.hllfrontline.com -> http://127.0.0.1:7010
#
# Keep both services bound to loopback. Caddy is intentionally not configured
# as a public origin because that would allow clients to bypass Cloudflare.
